-names></name><name><surname>Barros</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Souza</surname><given-names>CE</given-names></name><name><surname>Victorino</surname><given-names>JA</given-names></name><name><surname>Kacmarek</surname><given-names>RM</given-names></name><name><surname>Barbas</surname><given-names>CS</given-names></name><name><surname>Carvalho</surname><given-names>CR</given-names></name><name><surname>Amato</surname><given-names>MB</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Reversibility of lung collapse and hypoxemia in early acute respiratory distress syndrome</article-title><source>Am J Respir Crit Care Med</source><year>2006</year><volume>174</volume><fpage>268</fpage><lpage>278</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16690982</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1164/rccm.200506-976OC</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>